<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>兔子的蓝天 · 报告洞察</title><link>https://kongfurabbitz.github.io/insights/</link><description>研究、思考与实践</description><language>zh-CN</language><item><title>负责任AI如何进入日常决策：从原则走向证据</title><link>https://kongfurabbitz.github.io/insights/responsible-ai-governance-principles-to-evidence-2025/</link><guid>https://kongfurabbitz.github.io/insights/responsible-ai-governance-principles-to-evidence-2025/</guid><description>阅读WEF与埃森哲2025年实践指南，检验九项行动如何落到责任、数据、设计、事故响应与人的选择权，并辨清成熟度与案例的证据边界。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate></item><item><title>物理AI规模化：先证明持续运行，再验证第二现场</title><link>https://kongfurabbitz.github.io/insights/physical-ai-manufacturing-readiness-2026/</link><guid>https://kongfurabbitz.github.io/insights/physical-ai-manufacturing-readiness-2026/</guid><description>从TCS的300家制造企业调查出发，区分试验、部署与业务结果，审视数据、集成、技能和责任，并用全成本与第二现场检验规模化。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate></item><item><title>一线员工技术：从班次和工位出发，判断AI与平台的价值</title><link>https://kongfurabbitz.github.io/insights/frontline-technology-workflow-value-2026/</link><guid>https://kongfurabbitz.github.io/insights/frontline-technology-workflow-value-2026/</guid><description>解读Drake Star 2026市场报告：厘清一线技术的流程边界，审计大型交易与融资分类，并用真实工作结果决定自动化和采购。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate></item><item><title>企业AI支出进入千亿美元之后，怎样验证一项任务的价值</title><link>https://kongfurabbitz.github.io/insights/enterprise-ai-spend-task-value-menlo-2026/</link><guid>https://kongfurabbitz.github.io/insights/enterprise-ai-spend-task-value-menlo-2026/</guid><description>阅读Menlo Ventures企业AI现状2026，区分年化市场规模、渠道Token和企业净收益，用任务条件与全成本检验智能体扩展。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate></item><item><title>企业智能体从试点到生产：先把条件、责任和价值讲清楚</title><link>https://kongfurabbitz.github.io/insights/enterprise-ai-agents-production-readiness-2026/</link><guid>https://kongfurabbitz.github.io/insights/enterprise-ai-agents-production-readiness-2026/</guid><description>从Everest Group的112家大型企业调查出发，区分预期与结果，检查试点转生产、资金口径和持续运行条件，并保留更简单的替代方案。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate></item><item><title>AI优先CFO：让证据改变决策，让资源跟上结果</title><link>https://kongfurabbitz.github.io/insights/ai-first-cfo-capital-decisions-value-2026/</link><guid>https://kongfurabbitz.github.io/insights/ai-first-cfo-capital-decisions-value-2026/</guid><description>从IBM的1500名财务高管调查出发，审视决策权限、资金再配置和价值兑现，并厘清23%增长差异与25倍模型主张的证据边界。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate></item><item><title>智能体平台扩展之前，先让责任和审查能力跟上</title><link>https://kongfurabbitz.github.io/insights/agentic-it-platform-accountability-review-capacity-2026/</link><guid>https://kongfurabbitz.github.io/insights/agentic-it-platform-accountability-review-capacity-2026/</guid><description>从Oliver Wyman的平台运营模式报告出发，区分三类平台、六项运行能力和五项组织建议，检验成本、停止权及审查积压的边界。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate></item><item><title>AI 省下的时间，为什么没有自动变成价值？</title><link>https://kongfurabbitz.github.io/insights/ai-saved-time-to-value/</link><guid>https://kongfurabbitz.github.io/insights/ai-saved-time-to-value/</guid><description>任务变快，只是变化的起点。从时间碎片、流程瓶颈到结果验证，重新理解 AI 提效与真正收益之间的距离。</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate></item></channel></rss>
